### OBS-001: No Error Handling on Critical Business Operations
**Severity**: Critical
**Location**: Lines 7–10 (POST `/api/orders`), Lines 14–15 (DELETE `/api/users/:id`)

**Evidence**: The `POST /api/orders` handler calls three sequential async operations — `db.createOrder` (line 7), `paymentService.charge` (line 8), `emailService.sendConfirmation` (line 9) — with no `try/catch` and no Express error-handling middleware registered. The `DELETE /api/users/:id` handler (lines 14–15) has the same pattern.

